	(text "Audio out (same stage as the Picocomputer RP6502):\n- 220R/100R divider: 3.3 V PWM -> ~1 Vpp line level, ~69R source,\n  drives headphones directly.\n- 100nF with that ~69R: one pole at ~23 kHz; removes the PWM\n  carrier (clk_sys/1024: 146 kHz at 150 MHz).\n- 47uF blocks DC; 1.8K keeps the jack at 0 V (no plug-in pop).\n- MIA firmware: 48 kHz output, GP4 = left, GP5 = right."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 309.88 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "11c13d42-dd46-4dd0-a68f-e65624b79316")
	)
