	(text "J1, J2 expansion bus / J3 user port (VIA port B)\n- 3.3 V logic only: no 5 V signals on any pin.\n- A card claims one I/O slot by jumpering one of\n  ~{IOCS1}..~{IOCS7} ($C400-$DFFF, 1 KB each).\n- ~{IRQB}, ~{NMI} and RDY are wired-AND with pull-ups\n  on this board: cards pull them low through a Schottky\n  diode or an open-drain output, never drive them high.\n- +5V pins have no source yet (power section TBD)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 350.52 99.06 0)
